  "problem": "Consider the vector field $F(x,y,z)=⟨x,\\,y,\\,z+3⟩$ and a finite region $S$ of the plane $z=x+y$ such that $\\text{Area}(S)=\\sqrt{3}.$ Calculate the flux of $F$ through $S$ with respect to the upward-pointing unit normal vector $n.$",
